== Icelandic ==

=== Adverb ===

'''líka'''

# [[also]], [[as well]], [[likewise]]
#: ''Konan mín kom, og '''líka''' börnin mín.''
#:: My wife came, and '''also''' my children.
# [[so]], [[too]]
#: ''Ég vona að við hittumst aftur. - Ég '''líka'''.''
#:: I hope that we'll meet again. - '''So''' do I.

===Verb===
'''líka'''
# to [[like]]

====Usage notes====
*The verb '''''líka''''' is mostly used in compounds such as ''[[líka við]]''.

====Derived terms====
*[[líka við]]
*[[líka vel við]]
*[[líka illa við]]

